      "content": "that makes sense. but can you go a bit deeper into the actual \"moral weight\" they place on this? like, when they talk about these shifts being \"destructive\" or \"harmful\" to the soul or the community, how do they actually frame that? i want to understand the intensity of their stance—it feels like they see it as more than just a policy disagreement.",
