      "content": "it's interesting how they frame it as a \"crisis.\" so if you look at it from their point of view, are they basically saying that these secular changes are a symptom of a larger moral decay? like, is the loss of these traditional structures seen as an inevitable consequence of abandoning these religious foundations?",
